5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at the actual losses. I'll check the misrouted deliveries and the time lost to copying records.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about who actually does the work. I'll look into the staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We always ignore the groundwork. I'll investigate network coverage at customer plants and the handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I want to be sure about the funding source. I'll check the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
